 PREFIX ex: <https://example.org/lifecycle/>
 PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
 PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>
-ASK { gmeow:succeedsClaim rdfs:subPropertyOf gmeow:supersedes . gmeow:correctsClaim rdfs:domain gmeow:Entity ; rdfs:range gmeow:Entity . gmeow:retractsClaim rdfs:domain gmeow:Activity ; rdfs:range gmeow:Entity . }""" ;
-    gmeow:saRationale "Succession specializes supersession; correction is a relation between claim-bearing entities in its own right; actual withdrawal belongs to an activity, not a force individual." .
+PREFIX logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/>
