+    rdfs:label "unit price"@x-gmeow-english ;
+    skos:definition "An exact decimal ratio quantity expressing money per one counted unit of its pricedAsset. Its quotient reference frame retains a currency numerator and a mathematical count-frame denominator. The selected exact financial profile uses a crisp, unhosted scalar quotient frame with one scalar axis. It is not a MonetaryAmount; multiplying by a quantity of the same asset in the same count frame derives a MonetaryAmount without currency conversion."@x-gmeow-english ;
+    logic:subClassOf math:RatioQuantity ;
+    logic:disjointWith gmeow:MonetaryAmount ;
+    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxTBox .
