+    skos:definition "An explicitly selected computational measurement multiplying unitPrice by pricedQuantity. The price asset and denominator frame must exactly match the counted asset and count frame. The request declares its output currency through hasReferenceFrame, equal to the price numerator frame, and requires no temporal calculationPeriodBasis. Native execution derives one MonetaryAmount observationResult with proof."@x-gmeow-english ;
+    logic:subClassOf gmeow:Measurement ;
+    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxTBox .
