 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/SubsumedBy|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "The source pattern is narrower than the view: every source instance is a view instance but not conversely. Lowers to sssom:narrowMatch and an OWL subClassOf with the source as the subclass. The converse direction of logic:Subsumes, the second mid-lattice relation under logic:Equiv."
-msgstr "Le motif source est plus étroit que la vue : toute instance source est une instance de la vue mais non l'inverse. S'abaisse en sssom:narrowMatch et un OWL subClassOf avec la source comme sous-classe. La direction inverse de logic:Subsumes, la seconde relation de treillis médian sous logic:Equiv."
+msgid "The source pattern is subsumed by the view: every source instance is a view instance, without asserting the converse. A directional SKOS row uses skos:broadMatch from source to view, matching an OWL subClassOf from source to view. The conservative canonical alignment projection emits skos:relatedMatch rather than a subsumption edge. The converse direction of logic:Subsumes, the second mid-lattice relation under logic:Equiv."
+msgstr "Le motif source est subsumé par la vue : toute instance source est une instance de la vue, sans affirmer la réciproque. Une ligne SKOS directionnelle utilise skos:broadMatch de la source vers la vue, ce qui correspond à un OWL subClassOf de la source vers la vue. La projection canonique prudente d’alignement émet skos:relatedMatch plutôt qu’une arête de subsomption. La direction inverse de logic:Subsumes, la seconde relation de treillis médian sous logic:Equiv."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/Subsumes|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
-msgid "The source pattern is broader than the view: every view instance is a source instance but not conversely. Lowers to sssom:broadMatch and an OWL subClassOf with the view as the subclass. One of the two mid-lattice directional relations under logic:Equiv."
-msgstr "Le motif source est plus large que la vue : toute instance de la vue est une instance source mais non l'inverse. S'abaisse en sssom:broadMatch et un OWL subClassOf avec la vue comme sous-classe. L'une des deux relations directionnelles de treillis médian sous logic:Equiv."
+msgid "The source pattern subsumes the view: every view instance is a source instance, without asserting the converse. A directional SKOS row uses skos:narrowMatch from source to view, matching an OWL subClassOf from view to source. This semantic orientation does not strengthen the conservative canonical alignment projection, which emits skos:relatedMatch. One of the two mid-lattice directional relations under logic:Equiv."
+msgstr "Le motif source subsume la vue : toute instance de la vue est une instance source, sans affirmer la réciproque. Une ligne SKOS directionnelle utilise skos:narrowMatch de la source vers la vue, ce qui correspond à un OWL subClassOf de la vue vers la source. Cette orientation sémantique ne renforce pas la projection canonique prudente d’alignement, qui émet skos:relatedMatch. L’une des deux relations directionnelles de treillis médian sous logic:Equiv."
 
 msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/sufficientFor|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
 msgid "Relates a sub-gmeow:Goal whose satisfaction settles a gmeow:Goal on its own. Domain gmeow:Goal, range gmeow:Goal (stated in prose). The relation an logic:OrDecomposition groups: any one sufficient sub-goal settles the parent. One of the four decomposition relations carrying satisfaction dependency, distinct from gmeow:properPartOf (structural part-hood)."
